# Path-based routing configuration for Traefik reverse proxy
#
# Services are accessible via path-based routing at http://localhost:
# - http://localhost/qbittorrent - qBittorrent Web UI
# - http://localhost/prowlarr - Prowlarr indexer manager
# - http://localhost/radarr - Radarr movie manager
# - http://localhost/sonarr - Sonarr TV show manager
# - http://localhost:8081/dashboard/ - Traefik dashboard
#
# No /etc/hosts configuration needed!
# Simply start the stack with `docker compose up -d` and access services via the paths above.
